OL,3,GNEWSASchool failed to deal with racist
OL,4,Abullying, father claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family whose son says he suffered
OL,7,Fracist bullying have accused the school
OL,8,Fand council of failing to deal with the
OL,9,Fabuse.
OL,11,FThe son, who the BBC is not naming,
OL,12,Fsays racial slurs have been aimed at
OL,13,Fhim daily at Ysgol Dyffryn Conwy in
OL,14,FLlanrwst.
OL,16,FThe school say they do not tolerate any
OL,17,Fracism or bullying and that it is a
OL,18,Fsafe environment for all pupils.
